# Extended regular expressions, one per line, matched case-insensitively against
# every line and commit message that a push to a dot-files remote adds.
# Seeded to ~/.config/claude/push-denylist.txt by dotfiles-sync.sh. Keep real
# customer, repo and host names only in that private copy, never in this template.
/Users/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+/
